##### Design System Quick Reference

###### Roundness Values

| Enum | Radius | Feel | Tailwind parallel | Typical use |
|------|--------|------|-------------------|-------------|
| ROUND_FOUR | 4px | Sharp, precise | `rounded` | Fintech, enterprise, dev tools |
