##### World-Screen Coordinate Conversion

###### World to Screen

```javascript
function worldToScreen(position, camera) {
  const vector = position.clone();
  vector.project(camera);

  return {
    x: ((vector.x + 1) / 2) * window.innerWidth,
    y: (-(vector.y - 1) / 2) * window.innerHeight,
  };
}

